services.web.cap_add[0]  invalid value  capability entries must be scalar
services.web.deploy.resources.limits.cpus  invalid value  cpus must be greater than zero
services.web.deploy.resources.limits.devices  unknown field  remove it or pass --allow-unsupported
services.web.deploy.resources.limits.memory  invalid value  memory must be greater than zero
services.web.deploy.resources.limits.pids  invalid value  pids limit must be -1 or greater
services.web.deploy.resources.reservations  unsupported (planned)  resource reservations are not deployed yet; remove it or pass --allow-unsupported
services.web.deploy.resources.weird  unknown field  remove it or pass --allow-unsupported
services.web.deploy.restart_policy.condition  invalid value  unsupported restart policy "any"
services.web.deploy.restart_policy.delay  unsupported (planned)  restart policy subfields are not deployed yet; remove it or pass --allow-unsupported
services.web.healthcheck.disable  invalid value  disable must be a boolean
services.web.healthcheck.interval  invalid value  healthcheck duration must be greater than zero
services.web.healthcheck.mystery  unknown field  remove it or pass --allow-unsupported
services.web.healthcheck.test  invalid value  CMD-SHELL healthcheck needs exactly one command
services.web.restart  invalid value  unsupported restart policy "sometimes"
